# Shooting down over an edge: the end of a thatched roof's ridge at Lobart's farm, 7.3 m above a path, a wolf on
# the path 1 m out from the gable wall (8 m, ~80 deg down from the head). The wolf is put from the edge, then the
# hero steps back: put from 2 m back it would land on the roof.
#   stand_*: 60 cm from the edge, the bow drawn; the head must not see the wolf, the lean must (`sight`, `cansee`).
#   walk_*:  from 2 m back, walking (manual: steps with the bow drawn, classic: walk mode) up to the edge.
# Camera from the side (`cam follow 600 300 90`). bench.log: `pos` (y 2335 on the roof, ~1640 on the ground
# below: he fell), `cansee`, `anims ... target=`; events.jsonl: `sight` per frame
cheat god
set time 12 0
overlay off
view full
stats bow 100 talent 0
equip ItRw_Bow_L_01
give ItRw_Arrow 50
goto pos 14591 2349 -14597
wait 600
face 247.5
edge 247.5 2000 60
wait 300
clear 2500
insert Wolf
wait 300
put WOLF 160 0
wait 300
cam lift off
cam follow 600 300 90
cam look -240
# classic, standing 60 cm from the edge: drawn upright with the aim off (no target), then the aim on (the lean,
# the focus takes the wolf)
manual off
tap bow
wait 1500
goto pos 14591 2349 -14597
wait 400
face 247.5
edge 247.5 2000 60
wait 300
face 247.5
aim off
put WOLF 5000 0
wait 400
put WOLF 160 0
wait 300
rec stand_classic
press action
wait 1500
sight WOLF
cansee WOLF
anims
aim on
wait 2000
cansee WOLF
anims
stop
release action
wait 800
# manual, standing 60 cm from the edge: drawn at the wolf
manual on
aimat WOLF body
rec stand_manual
press action
wait 1500
sight WOLF
wait 1500
cansee WOLF
pos
stop
release action
aimat off
wait 800
# manual, walking: from 2 m back, drawn at the wolf, steps forward for 3 s
edge 247.5 2000 200
wait 300
face 247.5
pos
aimat WOLF body
rec walk_manual
press action
wait 1200
press forward
wait 3000
release forward
wait 1500
pos
cansee WOLF
anims
stop
release action
aimat off
wait 600
tap bow
wait 1200
# classic, walk mode: from 2 m back with the bow raised, walking for 3.5 s, then drawing
manual off
goto pos 14591 2349 -14597
wait 400
face 247.5
edge 247.5 2000 60
wait 300
face 247.5
put WOLF 5000 0
wait 300
put WOLF 160 0
wait 300
edge 247.5 2000 200
wait 300
face 247.5
walkmode walk
tap bow
wait 1500
rec walk_classic
press forward
wait 3500
release forward
wait 300
pos
press action
wait 2000
pos
cansee WOLF
anims
stop
release action
wait 600
walkmode run
